WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.480 --> 00:00:05.220
Game of Thrones fans witnessed the death of
Khal Drogo long ago, when the powerful warlord

00:00:05.220 --> 00:00:07.760
perished at the hands of his then-wife Daenerys
Targaryen.

00:00:07.760 --> 00:00:12.050
It was tough to say goodbye to the Dothraki
warrior, who proved himself to be something

00:00:12.050 --> 00:00:16.070
of a sensitive man when not engaged in acts
of violence on the battlefield.

00:00:16.070 --> 00:00:19.770
Few can forget how they felt when they watched
Dany smother him with a pillow to put him

00:00:19.770 --> 00:00:23.060
out of his misery after he was poisoned by
a vengeful magician.

00:00:23.060 --> 00:00:26.650
These episodes premiered in 2011, which feels
like a lifetime ago.

00:00:26.650 --> 00:00:30.910
But Khal Drogo experienced something of a
second death when actor Jason Momoa shaved

00:00:30.910 --> 00:00:33.900
off his signature beard for the first time
since 2012.

00:00:33.900 --> 00:00:37.969
Momoa, who appeared as Khal Drogo on Game
of Thrones for only 10 episodes and still

00:00:37.969 --> 00:00:41.989
managed to win the hearts of millions, posted
a video of himself shearing off his famous

00:00:41.989 --> 00:00:45.160
facial hair to his YouTube channel on April
17.

00:00:45.160 --> 00:00:49.540
Out in the open wilderness, presumably on
location filming the Dune reboot, the actor

00:00:49.540 --> 00:00:51.569
took an electric clipper to his beard.

00:00:51.569 --> 00:00:55.440
With each chunk he shaved off, the actor bid
farewell to a character he played while rocking

00:00:55.440 --> 00:00:56.040
it.

00:00:56.200 --> 00:00:57.960
"Bye, Drogo.

00:00:58.980 --> 00:01:00.880
Bye, Arthur Curry."

00:01:01.020 --> 00:01:04.339
The actor quickly revealed that he wasn't
getting rid of his whiskers all willy-nilly.

00:01:04.339 --> 00:01:09.440
Rather, Momoa stripped his strapping face
of all its hair and stubble for a good cause:

00:01:09.440 --> 00:01:14.140
to increase awareness about the importance
of reducing plastic to help preserve the environment.

00:01:14.520 --> 00:01:17.560
"I just want to do this to bring awareness.

00:01:17.560 --> 00:01:21.900
Plastics are killing our planet, and I think
I have a solution."

00:01:22.120 --> 00:01:28.420
Momoa continued, detailing that he's launching
a line of aluminum cans of water that are

00:01:28.420 --> 00:01:29.920
completely recyclable.

00:01:29.920 --> 00:01:31.060
According to the actor,

00:01:41.980 --> 00:01:43.100
As he puts it,

00:01:43.900 --> 00:01:47.660
"It's just water, but I feel good about it."

00:01:47.860 --> 00:01:51.840
As Momoa cleaned up the last remaining hairs
on his face, he gave a little shout out to

00:01:51.840 --> 00:01:54.680
his superhero character to drive his point
home, saying,

00:02:01.060 --> 00:02:03.120
And now, apparently, so is Momoa.

00:02:03.130 --> 00:02:07.070
A video as momentous as Momoa buzzing off
the beard he's had for the better part of

00:02:07.070 --> 00:02:11.140
a decade was bound to garner a ton of attention,
and it got people talking.

00:02:11.140 --> 00:02:15.580
Fans quickly flocked to the comments section
of the video and to Twitter to react to beardless

00:02:15.590 --> 00:02:16.590
Momoa.

00:02:16.590 --> 00:02:20.749
Many, like Twitter user @MissDonnaCooke, pointed
out the unfortunate truth that not only do

00:02:20.749 --> 00:02:24.620
we live in a world where most people don't
recycle, but we now also live in a world where

00:02:24.620 --> 00:02:26.689
Jason Momoa no longer has a beard.

00:02:26.689 --> 00:02:27.719
She wrote in her post,

00:02:27.719 --> 00:02:31.810
"Well done guys, first you destroyed the planet
and now you destroy Jason Momoa's beard.

00:02:31.810 --> 00:02:33.459
I don't know which is worse.

00:02:33.459 --> 00:02:34.689
Shame on you all."

00:02:34.689 --> 00:02:37.569
She also appended the hashtag "bring back
the beard."

00:02:37.569 --> 00:02:41.709
Judging by the reactions to the YouTube video,
which has drawn over 4 million views after

00:02:41.709 --> 00:02:45.909
only a couple of days, people think Momoa
still looks great, with or without a beard.

00:02:45.909 --> 00:02:49.529
Many were more blown away by the actor's activism
than by his new look.

00:02:49.529 --> 00:02:52.200
As one fan wrote on Twitter, "With and without
beard!!

00:02:52.200 --> 00:02:53.230
He's still attractive.

00:02:53.230 --> 00:02:57.500
Jason Momoa shaving his beard for a good cause. Spreading awareness, and a solution."

00:02:57.500 --> 00:03:00.200
At the end of the day, hair does grow back.

00:03:00.200 --> 00:03:03.819
In a way, it's just as infinitely recyclable
a resource as aluminum.

00:03:03.819 --> 00:03:08.330
So Momoa might again sport the lush Khal Drogo
beard his fans clearly love one day.

00:03:08.330 --> 00:03:12.209
Whether or not that happens, though, one thing's
for certain: Momoa will continue trying to

00:03:12.209 --> 00:03:17.459
save the planet, and that's arguably more
awesome than anything Drogo did in Aquaman.

